---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Constitution of the United States Privacy Notice - LogicPath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Notice</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>The Constitution of the United States</strong></p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 17, 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>LogicPath Systems ("we", "our" or "us") makes The Constitution of the United States, a free, ad-supported reader for the text of the Constitution. This notice explains what happens to information when you use the app.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
                    <p>We do not collect, store or transmit personal data to our own servers. The app has no accounts and nothing to sign in to. Specifically:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>No name, email address or phone number</li>
                        <li>No location data</li>
                        <li>No access to your camera, microphone, contacts or photos</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>2. What is stored on your device</h2>
                    <p>The app saves the following on your device only, using the system preferences store:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Kept passages</strong> — the passages you pin</li>
                        <li><strong>Notes</strong> — anything you write about a passage</li>
                        <li><strong>Reading record</strong> — how many passages you have opened, your daily run, and your Recall results</li>
                        <li><strong>Recently opened</strong> — the last few passages you read</li>
                        <li><strong>Looked-up words</strong> — your recent searches</li>
                        <li><strong>Reading preferences</strong> — type size, typeface and page theme</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This data never leaves your device, and we cannot see it.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>3. Advertising</h2>
                    <p>The app shows advertisements through Google AdMob, which pays for its development. AdMob may automatically collect:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Device identifiers, including the Advertising ID</li>
                        <li>IP address</li>
                        <li>Approximate location at country or region level, not precise location</li>
                        <li>App usage and interaction with the ads</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Google AdMob handles that data under <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Your consent.</strong> If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Switzerland, the app asks for your choices about advertising through Google's consent message before any ad is requested. You can change those choices at any time from About this app &gt; Privacy choices for ads. Where no consent is given, ads may still appear but are not personalised.</p>
                    <p>You can also limit personalised advertising on your device under Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads (or Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Ads), or at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>4. Analytics</h2>
                    <p>The app uses Google Firebase Analytics to count screen views and basic usage, so we can see which parts of the app are used. These reports are aggregated and do not identify you. Firebase is also governed by <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>4a. Daily reminders</h2>
                    <p>The app can show two reading reminders a day, at 1 pm and 7 pm. They are scheduled on your device by the app itself:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>No message is fetched from a server, and nothing about you is sent anywhere</li>
                        <li>The text of each reminder is a short passage from the Constitution, bundled with the app</li>
                        <li>Android asks your permission the first time you open the app, and you can refuse</li>
                        <li>You can switch them off later under About this app &gt; Daily reminders, or in your system notification settings</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>5. Permissions</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Internet</strong> — to load advertisements. The text of the Constitution is bundled in the app and is readable offline.</li>
                        <li><strong>Text-to-speech</strong> — to read a passage aloud using the voice built into your device.</li>
                        <li><strong>Share</strong> — to pass text to another app through the system share sheet.</li>
                        <li><strong>Notifications</strong> — to show the daily reading reminders, if you allow them.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>No camera, microphone, contacts or storage permission is requested.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
                    <div class="table-wrapper">
                        <table>
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Service</th>
                                    <th>Purpose</th>
                                    <th>Privacy policy</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Google AdMob</td>
                                    <td>Advertisements</td>
                                    <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Link</a></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Google Mobile Ads SDK</td>
                                    <td>Ad delivery</td>
                                    <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Link</a></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Google Firebase Analytics</td>
                                    <td>Usage counts</td>
                                    <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Link</a></td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <p>The typeface used in the app is bundled with it and makes no network requests.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>7. Children</h2>
                    <p>The app is a general-audience reference and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13. Advertisements are served by Google AdMob under Google's advertising policies.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>8. Deleting your data</h2>
                    <p>Everything the app saves is on your device, so you can remove it at any time by:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Clearing the app's data under Settings &gt; Apps &gt; The Constitution &gt; Clear data, or</li>
                        <li>Uninstalling the app</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Nothing remains on any server of ours, because we do not run one.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>9. Changes to this notice</h2>
                    <p>We may update this notice. Any change will appear in the app with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
                    <p>LogicPath Systems<br/>
                    Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .table-wrapper {
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-content th,
    .legal-content td {
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .legal-content th {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
</style>
